  "title": "How to Make Beef Satay",
  "description": "This beef satay recipe is Chef John&#39;s version of the popular Thai Malaysian appetizer of grilled sirloin strips flavored with sweet, zesty marinade.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
